{"data":{"body":"[P2] Reject trailing content for every JSON root\n\nThe EOF check only runs for a top-level object. Inputs such as `[] trailing` or `\"value\" {}` return here after reading one token, so malformed JSON is silently treated as a non-object preview. Consume and validate the full document in `buildPreviewFromJson` for scalar and array roots too, while preserving intentional object-budget truncation, and add trailing-token tests for those roots.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7ojjvv","finding_digest":"30eb434ee10300b105536cf6f9bc7c17551e375dfb42216028a993b010a8d174","finding_id":"arf_v1_gdvugtxbamalcbktnt3ptpd4c5","finding_key":"serdes-preview::build-preview-from-json::reject-trailing-json-content","identity_key":"serdes-preview::build-preview-from-json::reject-trailing-json-content","line":127,"observation_digest":"0026c2c8ff089d4f54ce0d0a9afd7b24aca8e8f50ecd216c14a2378026793414","observation_id":"aro_v1_aatmfsh7bcou6vgobufjv7l3es","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/serde/filesystem/SerDesPreview.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_gdvugtxbamalcbktnt3ptpd4c5","published_at":"2026-09-01T07:12:34Z","review_id":"arr_v1_nvfm7epserfw3arvg7ykz2uszi","reviewed_base_sha":"391d78894ba4e215c07a88dcc3ce20288f41d405","reviewed_head_sha":"bfd90011acdf2c210febc5e1e59073bc304dbd07","reviewer":"codex","start_line":118,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":648},"record_id":"art_v1_345mlskdgz6zdyzlwamas3djl6","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-01T07:12:34Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
